### Handover Validation Checklist

```markdown
## Handover Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] All environment access credentials transferred
- [ ] Infrastructure-as-code state accessible to receiving team
- [ ] Monitoring dashboards visible and operational
- [ ] Alert routing tested and confirmed working
- [ ] Backup restore procedure validated
- [ ] CI/CD pipeline access granted
- [ ] Documentation completeness verified
- [ ] Training sessions completed (minimum 3 per role)
- [ ] Shadow operations period completed without major issues
- [ ] All known issues documented and communicated
- [ ] Post-transition support agreement signed
- [ ] Signatures obtained from both teams and sponsors
```

